  - name: "Super Endurance"
    description: "As the American Juicer: adds 1D4x100 S.D.C., 1D4x10 hit points and 2D6 to P.E. (all in the pools and bonuses above). Lifts and carries far more than a normal person, resists exhaustion and needs little sleep, as described for the Juicer in the Rifts RPG."
  - name: "Super Strength"
    description: "Slightly less than the regular Juicer''s, traded for balance and stealth: +2D4+2 to P.S., minimum P.S. 20 (adjust up to 20 if lower)."
